dttypes: POSIX regcomp/regexec on SVR4.

dttypes matches with <regex.h> on Linux and the BSDs and with the old
<regexp.h> compile/step macros elsewhere. SVR4's <regexp.h> is K&R code
that a modern compiler rejects. Take the POSIX branch on SVR4: the build
links a POSIX regex library there.

